{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What do you really remember from that night?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twenty years after the Letherfall tragedy, Dylan is haunted by dreams that feel more vivid than reality. Fragmented visions. Familiar voices. Presences that don\u2019t belong to this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this playable demo, you\u2019ll experience the first steps of Dylan\u2019s return to the abandoned village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A place haunted not only by shadows and decay, but by his own memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \u2022    Oppressive atmosphere inspired by psychological survival horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \u2022    Exploration and survival mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \u2022    Fragmented storytelling between dreams and nightmares</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \u2022    Disturbing entities that respond to your actions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the first descent into madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out if you have the strength to remember\u2026 or if some truths are better left buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41 The truth awaits. Download the demo now.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943520?t=1757420502","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943520/4a301d538ee5d700fd21a1d2fc51c11cf6b65d48/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757420502","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943520/435fa538790397cadeacef72ed7b97b427ddbc5c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757420502","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943520/435fa538790397cadeacef72ed7b97b427ddbc5c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757420502","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{